{
  "$description": "Ather visual identity — the complete design tokens (colours, typography, spacing, radii, sizes, motion, brand mark). Source of truth: lib/core/theme/, lib/core/motion/springs.dart, lib/core/branding/ather_brand.dart. Colours are #RRGGBB or #RRGGBBAA (alpha last, CSS order).",
  "name": "Ather",
  "version": "1.0.0",

  "principles": [
    "White + grey + black, ONE brand blue (accent), ONE red (wrong), ONE green (right). No other hues, no gradients, no glows.",
    "Blue means ACTIVE (selected tab, progress fill, ticked checkbox, primary button). It never means correct.",
    "Red means wrong / weak (<50%) / overdue / delete. Green means right / mastered (>=90%). Green never means selected.",
    "No shadows anywhere. The card is the elevation: depth comes only from a card sitting on a page of a different value.",
    "Dark is a re-mapping of light, not a redesign. wrong and right keep identical values in both themes.",
    "Text colour for red/green words uses wrongText / rightText (contrast-safe), fills use wrong / right.",
    "'No data yet' is grey and shown as '—', never red and never '0%'.",
    "Every number uses tabular figures. Never use a font weight above 700.",
    "Spacing is a 4-grid ladder only: 4 · 8 · 12 · 16 · 20 · 24. No invented sizes at call sites.",
    "Concentric radii: inner radius = container radius − padding between them.",
    "No splash/ripple effects, no scrollbars, no scroll tint. Press feedback is scale(0.97).",
    "Primary language is Arabic (RTL). Page transitions move vertically so they are direction-neutral."
  ],

  "colors": {
    "light": {
      "pageBackground": "#EFEFF2",
      "card": "#FFFFFF",
      "muted": "#F4F4F6",
      "fill": "#F1F1F4",
      "track": "#E9E9EC",
      "textPrimary": "#000000",
